--- ws_whatwg_wasm -- WASM WHATWG-style WebSocket client (browser WebSocket backend).
---
--- This is the WASM implementation of the WHATWG WebSocket API,
--- backed by the browser's native WebSocket API via wasm-bindgen.
--- On non-wasm targets, a stub module with no functions is provided.
---
--- ## connection API
--- ws_whatwg_wasm.ws_whatwg_wasm -- return the module name and type.
--- ws_whatwg_wasm.connect -- connect to a WebSocket URL, returning a connection handle.
--- ws_whatwg_wasm.send -- send a message on a connection.
--- ws_whatwg_wasm.recv -- receive the next message on a connection, or null if empty.
--- ws_whatwg_wasm.close -- close a connection.
cap "ws_whatwg_wasm.ws_whatwg_wasm"
cap "ws_whatwg_wasm.connect"
cap "ws_whatwg_wasm.send"
cap "ws_whatwg_wasm.recv"
cap "ws_whatwg_wasm.close"
